# Copies the GSD/Claude Code tooling install into every new worktree
# (`claude --worktree`, subagent worktrees, desktop parallel sessions).
# Without this, hooks and gsd-core/bin/gsd-tools.cjs are missing in a
# fresh worktree because they're gitignored, not tracked.
# Uses .gitignore syntax; see https://code.claude.com/docs/en/worktrees.md
.claude/gsd-core/
.claude/hooks/
.claude/commands/
.claude/agents/
.claude/scripts/
.claude/.gsd-profile
.claude/.gsd-staging/
.claude/gsd-file-manifest.json
.claude/gsd-install-state.json
